The Dynamo-MoE extensions consolidate and revise the supplied prefill and
decodes modifications. Changed integration points are DefaultModelLoader,
FusedMoE, GPUModelRunner, DeepseekV2MoE and RequestLogger. Scheduling,
checkpoint transfers, and EP/TP transitions are separated into vllm/dynamo_moe.
The standalone numerical reference is in reference/dynamo_moe.

Associated paper:
Jiahao Chen, Shigang Li, Rongtian Fu, Tong Wu, Zhi Ma, and Jingkun Dong.
Dynamo-MoE: Accelerating Sparse Large Model Inference with Dynamic Parallelization.
HPDC 2026. DOI: 10.1145/3806645.3807820.
